#: src/routes/settings.tsx:2132
msgid "Forces Chromium's ANGLE layer to use OpenGL instead of the default backend (Vulkan on Linux). Can fix GPU process crashes on NVIDIA drivers with broken Vulkan support. Requires an app restart."
msgstr "强制 Chromium 的 ANGLE 层使用 OpenGL 而非默认后端（Linux 上为 Vulkan）。可修复 NVIDIA 驱动程序 Vulkan 支持损坏导致的 GPU 进程崩溃。需要重启应用程序。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:2148
msgid "Forces fallback to WebGL 1. Some NVIDIA driver versions have broken WebGL 2 implementations that cause context loss and renderer crashes. Requires an app restart."
msgstr "强制回退到 WebGL 1。某些 NVIDIA 驱动版本的 WebGL 2 实现存在问题，会导致上下文丢失和渲染器崩溃。需要重启应用程序。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:2036
msgid "Forces software rasterization instead of using the GPU. Can fix visual artifacts or crashes on some GPU drivers. Requires an app restart."
msgstr "强制使用软件光栅化而非 GPU。可修复某些 GPU 驱动上的视觉伪影或崩溃。需要重启应用程序。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:2068
msgid "Forces software video decoding instead of GPU-accelerated decode. Can fix video playback issues or crashes. Requires an app restart."
msgstr "强制使用软件视频解码而非 GPU 加速解码。可修复视频播放问题或崩溃。需要重启应用程序。"

#: src/routes/settings.tsx:2100
msgid "Forces software video encoding instead of GPU-accelerated encode (NVENC). Can fix crashes when the GPU is under heavy concurrent load from WebGL rendering. Requires an app restart."
msgstr "强制使用软件视频编码而非 GPU 加速编码（NVENC）。可修复 GPU 在 WebGL 渲染的高并发负载下出现的崩溃。需要重启应用程序。"

